    "sub_name": "Python程式設計",
    "sub_ename": "PROGRAMMING WITH PYTHON",
    "describe_ch": "本課程將以python作為程式編寫語言，藉由本課程對於python程式語言的介紹與實作，學生將了解python的開發環境、其流程及結構，並具備python基礎程式撰寫與應用能力，進而擁有程式問題解決能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course will use python as the programming language. Through the introduction and implementation of the python programming language in this course, students will understand the python development environment, its process and structure, and have the basic python programming and application skills, and then have Program problem-solving ability.",
